#### 6. Missing HTTPS/TLS Configuration
**Issue**: Application doesn't enforce HTTPS, leaving it vulnerable to man-in-the-middle attacks.

**Recommendation**: Configure Express to trust proxy headers and enforce HTTPS in production.

