### Secret Detection Patterns to Avoid Committing
These patterns should trigger warnings in pre-commit hooks:
- `password\s*[:=]\s*["']?[\w\-~!@#$%^&*()_+={}|\":;?<>,.]+["']?`
- `api[_-]?key\s*[:=]\s*["']?[\w\-~!@#$%^&*()_+={}|\":;?<>,.]+["']?`
